WEBVTT

00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:13.950
Beat...

00:00:13.950 --> 00:00:16.160
Those wings!

00:00:16.160 --> 00:00:18.460
I'll wipe the floor with you!

00:00:21.330 --> 00:00:22.790
You're weak!

00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:26.340
I want to bring Shiki back to life!

00:00:27.630 --> 00:00:28.840
Hey.

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:32.640
How long are you going to mope?

00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:34.890
Until we get a new mission.

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:39.180
It's a new day, but...

